from Moscow in Veronis Russian military helicopters opened fire on them.

00:01:48.370 --> 00:01:53.239
A warehouse and fuel tanks were destroyed and Wagar forces reportedly shot down 

00:01:53.250 --> 00:01:55.709
six Russian helicopters and a plane.

00:01:57.410 --> 00:02:02.059
Wagner forces continued to move north but by the time they were within 125 

00:02:02.069 --> 00:02:03.169
